WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.610
- [Commentator] Good
morning to you and "bore da"

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.700
from inside Caernarfon castle

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.340
where the preparations are now complete

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.370
for the arrival of Her Majesty

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:13.093
and of course the young man
who will one day succeed her.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.803
(train engine roars)

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:21.790
It's a large turnout for the prince today

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:24.080
and the mood among the
gathering crowds is one

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.410
of anticipation, excitement

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:29.883
and, some might say, palpable tension.

00:00:32.716 --> 00:00:34.016
- You're going to be fine.

00:00:35.221 --> 00:00:38.554
(gentle dramatic music)

00:00:42.758 --> 00:00:45.508
(dramatic music)

00:00:58.109 --> 00:01:00.692
(crowd cheers)

00:01:04.482 --> 00:01:05.315
- Charles!

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:06.684
Charles!

00:01:06.684 --> 00:01:09.267
(crowd cheers)

00:01:17.293 --> 00:01:20.024
- [Commentator] A good
response from the onlookers.

00:01:20.024 --> 00:01:22.660
Only a few boos could be heard

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:26.387
and otherwise the Welsh people
showing enormous support.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:31.221
(suspenseful music)

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:38.178
(crowd clapping)

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:45.016
- Two minutes, your Royal Highness.

00:01:45.016 --> 00:01:47.766
(crowd clapping)

00:01:51.756 --> 00:01:54.756
(suspenseful music)

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:03.210
(dramatic music)

00:02:41.656 --> 00:02:44.963
- I, Charles, Prince of Wales,

00:02:45.972 --> 00:02:48.640
do become your liege man of life and limb

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:52.530
and of earthly worship

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:59.970
and faith and truth I will bear unto thee

00:03:02.514 --> 00:03:05.283
to live and die against
all manner of folks.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.073
- Shh!

00:04:20.543 --> 00:04:21.376
- Shh!

00:05:29.155 --> 00:05:31.905
(dramatic music)

00:05:36.211 --> 00:05:38.961
(dramatic music)

